      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Reference amount is 1 kg of iron or non-alloy steel wire supplied for baling and material binding. CPC 41263 describes the material identity; the previous fencing/barbed-wire classification was inconsistent with the generic baling-wire definition. Exact grade, diameter, strength, coating and supplier are unspecified. The consuming Process separately reports wire cuts and attached wire; any composition proxy remains a declared Process assumption. No measured quality or external compliance review is claimed.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "参考量为1 kg用于打包及物料捆扎的铁或非合金钢丝，按CPC 41263标明材料身份。原围栏刺铁丝分类与通用捆扎线定义不一致。未指定牌号、直径、强度、涂层及供应商；消费过程另行披露线材边角料与附着包装数量，组成代理仅作为过程假设，不宣称实测品质或外部合规评审。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
